      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>General explanation attachment</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>PRIMARY EXEMPT PURPOSE: CHARITABLE. THE SPECIFIC PURPOSE FOR WHICH THE ORGANIZATION HAS BEEN ORGANIZED IS TO BE A COMMUNITY DEVELOPMENT ORGANIZATION SERVING LOCAL AND FOREIGN COMMUNITIES BY ENGAGING IN A BROAD RANGE OF STRATEGIES THAT PROMOTE COMMUNITY HEALTH, EDUCATION, AND DEVELOPMENT, TO AID IN DEVELOPING LIFE SKILLS AND FACILITATE JOB TRAINING AMONG INDIVIDUALS AND FAMILIES, PROVIDE ECONOMIC AND FINANCIAL SUPPORT AND TO ALSO ENGAGE IN ACTIVITIES WHICH ARE NECESSARY, SUITABLE OR CONVENIENT FOR THE ACCOMPLISHMENT OF THAT PURPOSE. . ACCOMPLISHMENTS: . THROUGH OUR PATHWAY COACHING PROGRAM, WE SUPPORTED 17 HIGH SCHOOL SENIORS AND RECENT GRADUATES THROUGH MENTORSHIP, HELPING THEM BUILD CONFIDENCE, DISCOVER A PATHWAY FOR THEIR LIFE, AND ESTABLISH A LONG-TERM SUPPORT SYSTEM FOR FUTURE SUCCESS. . AWARDED $7,000 IN SCHOLARSHIPS TO STUDENTS IN NEED OF FINANCIAL ASSISTANCE ENTERING COLLEGE. . SUPPORTED CRAWFORD HIGH SCHOOLS TITLE I SOCCER PROGRAM BY PROVIDING ACADEMIC TUTORING FOR OVER 40 STUDENTS FROM NOVEMBER TO DECEMBER, RESULTING IN A SIGNIFICANT INCREASE IN PLAYER ACADEMIC ELIGIBILITY FOR THE SEASON.</ExplanationTxt>
